{"id":"conocido","lemma":"conocido","pos":"adj","rank":678,"glosses":["known","well-known, famous, renowned","familiar"],"ipa":"/konoˈθido/","forms":{"feminine":"conocida","masculinePlural":"conocidos","femininePlural":"conocidas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/97/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-conocido.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me acuerdo de haberte conocido antes.","en":"I remember meeting you before.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803814","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"agreement"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"earlier"}]},{"text":"Esa canción me resulta conocida.","en":"That song sounds familiar to me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589756","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"song"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to result","l":"resultar"},null]},{"text":"Ninguno en la fiesta me era conocido.","en":"I didn't know anyone at the party.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/299206","words":[{"g":"nobody"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"party"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Nunca he conocido a nadie como tú.","en":"I've never met anyone like you before.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/456735","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"no one"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"Él tiene muchos conocidos pero pocos amigos.","en":"He has many acquaintances but few friends.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null,{"g":"but"},{"g":"little, not much","l":"poco"},{"g":"friend","l":"amigo"}]}]}